[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'they\'re interacted with or if they\'re just put in a body, they do become more complex. Their brain waves actually do look very much like that of a pre-term baby and we only know that because when a baby is born pre-term, you can do an EEG. Prior'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
